NVMM, the NetBSD Virtual Machine Monitor, ported to FreeBSD: the nvmm.ko
kernel module (Intel VT-x with EPT), libnvmm, nvmmctl(8) and the libnvmm
tests. QEMU uses it with -accel nvmm. It replaces vmm.ko (bhyve): the two
cannot be loaded together.

/dev/nvmm belongs to the nvmm group, which this package creates with GID 402.
